{
  "id": "JHN.17",
  "number": "17",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "John 17",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These things spake Jesus; and lifting up his eyes to heaven, he said, Father, the hour is come; glorify thy Son, that the Son may glorify thee: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "even as thou gavest him authority over all flesh, that to all whom thou hast given him, he should give eternal life. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And this is life eternal, that they should know thee the only true God, and him whom thou didst send, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Jesus Christ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I glorified thee on the earth, having accomplished the work which thou hast given me to do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now, Father, glorify thou me with thine own self with the glory which I had with thee before the world was. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I manifested thy name unto the men whom thou gavest me out of the world: thine they were, and thou gavest them to me; and they have kept thy word. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now they know that all things whatsoever thou hast given me are from thee: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the words which thou gavest me I have given unto them; and they received ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and knew of a truth that I came forth from thee, and they believed that thou didst send me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I pray for them: I pray not for the world, but for those whom thou hast given me; for they are thine: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and all things that are mine are thine, and thine are mine: and I am glorified in them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I am no more in the world, and these are in the world, and I come to thee. Holy Father, keep them in thy name which thou hast given me, that they may be one, even as we ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While I was with them, I kept them in thy name which thou hast given me: and I guarded them, and not one of them perished, but the son of perdition; that the scripture might be fulfilled. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But now I come to thee; and these things I speak in the world, that they may have my joy made full in themselves. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have given them thy word; and the world hated them, because they are not of the world, even as I am not of the world. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I pray not that thou shouldest take them from the world, but that thou shouldest keep them from the evil ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They are not of the world, even as I am not of the world. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sanctify them in the truth: thy word is truth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As thou didst send me into the world, even so sent I them into the world. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And for their sakes I sanctify myself, that they themselves also may be sanctified in truth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neither for these only do I pray, but for them also that believe on me through their word; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that they may all be one; even as thou, Father, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in me, and I in thee, that they also may be in us: that the world may believe that thou didst send me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the glory which thou hast given me I have given unto them; that they may be one, even as we ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " one; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I in them, and thou in me, that they may be perfected into one; that the world may know that thou didst send me, and lovedst them, even as thou lovedst me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Father, I desire that they also whom thou hast given me be with me where I am, that they may behold my glory, which thou hast given me: for thou lovedst me before the foundation of the world. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O righteous Father, the world knew thee not, but I knew thee; and these knew that thou didst send me; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and I made known unto them thy name, and will make it known; that the love wherewith thou lovedst me may be in them, and I in them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "JHN.18",
    "number": "18",
    "bookId": "JHN"
  },
